# Redirects for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# NOTE: the www → apex redirect does NOT live here. Cloudflare Pages
# _redirects only accepts path sources (e.g. "/old /new 301") — an
# absolute URL as the source is rejected as an invalid line, which is
# what the first deploy log reported. Host-specific redirects belong in
# the Cloudflare dashboard instead: Rules → Redirect Rules →
# "www.jonathanmccallum.com/* → https://jonathanmccallum.com/$1", 301.
# See work/seo-security-audit.md.
#
# Path redirects (same host) can be added below, one per line:
# /old-path /new-path 301
/feed/ /feed/index.xml 301
